Upstream-Name: Standard ML of New Jersey
Upstream-Contact: The SML/NJ Fellowship <smlnj-dev-list@lists.sourceforge.net>
Source: https://www.smlnj.org/dist/working/
Comment:
 Upstream distributes the system as a collection of separate tarballs.
 The orig tarball is assembled from them by debian/mkorig (via uscan),
 and also includes the upstream boot images needed to bootstrap the
 compiler (bootstrap/).  See debian/README.Debian.

